{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-serenity-mansion","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"serenity-mansion","about":"Welcome to the epitome of architectural brilliance and luxurious living at Serenity Mansions, nestled within the prestigious enclave of Tilal Al Ghaf. This awe-inspiring residential development, brought to you by the renowned Majid Al Futtaim, presents an unmatched collection of exquisitely designed 6 and 7-bedroom mansions, epitomizing the relentless pursuit of luxury and sophistication. Envisioned by internationally acclaimed designer firms, the three iconic design styles—Luna, Ayla, and Ara—gracefully adorn these mansions, creating a visual masterpiece. Set against the backdrop of picturesque lagoons and pristine white sandy beaches, this exclusive edition of residences unveils an enchanting ambience that exudes luxury and tranquillity.Situated in the heart of Tilal Al Ghaf, one of Dubai’s most coveted communities, Serenity Mansions enjoys a prime location that seamlessly connects residents to central business districts, esteemed educational institutions, and an array of recreational hubs. The ease of accessibility to key destinations ensures a lifestyle of convenience and unlimited opportunities.","price":25000000,"title":"Serenity Mansion","bitrix":{"id":24,"pf_id":"are.2.12867","source":null,"project_id":"Serenity Mansions","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Serenity Mansion","property_type":null,"developer_name":"Majid Al Futtaim","project_location":"Tilal Al Ghaf"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/feature_d10b6a6d7e.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/feature_d10b6a6d7e.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.02426745,"lng":55.223829964382},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/serenity_1_1bd07ec67f.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpw